    <description>Wall-mounted brushed stainless range hood: 0.800 x 0.500 canopy with its underside at 1.600 m and a chimney running to a 2.5 m ceiling. Sized to the scaled Oven (top at 0.900), giving 0.700 m above the cooktop - within the usual 0.600-0.750. Fuel has no range hood. Model origin is on the FLOOR at the canopy centre, so place it at z=0.</description>
</model>
